## Instructions

Install the numpy requirement using `python3 -m pip install numpy`.

Then run any of the following scripts:
`next_word_suggester_v2.py` (not final), which uses embeddings for smarter suggestions.
`next_word_suggester_v1.py` initial version which uses probability matrices.
`suggester_gui.py` runs an interactive GUI version of version 2 of the suggester.

You can run any of the three with `python <filename>.py`.